  "How long does it take to start investing?": "Koliko časa traja, da začnete investirati?",
  "Most members complete registration in a few minutes. Once your first deposit is processed, you can activate a plan straight away.": "Večina članov opravi registracijo v nekaj minutah. Ko je vaš prvi depozit obdelan, lahko takoj aktivirate načrt.",
  "Are there hidden fees?": "Ali obstajajo skriti stroški?",
  "All costs are shown transparently before you commit. You will always see what applies to your plan, with no surprises.": "Vsi stroški so pregledno prikazani, preden se zavežete. Vedno boste videli, kaj velja za vaš načrt, brez presenečenj.",
  "What is the minimum age to register?": "Kakšna je najnižja starost za registracijo?",
  "You must be at least 18 to open an account and invest. Verification may be requested to confirm your age and identity.": "Za odprtje računa in vlaganje morate imeti vsaj 18 let. Za potrditev vaše starosti in identitete bo morda zahtevano preverjanje.",
  "Which payment methods are accepted?": "Kateri načini plačila so sprejeti?",
  "Common methods such as debit and credit cards, bank transfers, selected e-wallets and cryptocurrencies are accepted. The exact options are shown at the deposit step.": "Sprejemajo se običajni načini, kot so debetne in kreditne kartice, bančna nakazila, izbrane e-denarnice in kriptovalute. Točne možnosti so prikazane v koraku depozita.",
  "When is customer support available?": "Kdaj je na voljo podpora strankam?",
  "Our support team is available Monday to Friday, 9:00 to 18:00, and commits to answering each enquiry within one working day.": "Naša skupina za podporo je na voljo od ponedeljka do petka od 9.00 do 18.00 in se zavezuje, da bo na vsako poizvedbo odgovorila v enem delovnem dnevu.",
  "How are taxes on gains handled?": "Kako se obravnavajo davki na dobiček?",
  "Taxes on investment gains depend on the rules in your country and are your responsibility. We recommend keeping your own records and speaking to a qualified tax adviser.": "Davki na naložbene dobičke so odvisni od pravil v vaši državi in ​​so vaša odgovornost. Priporočamo, da vodite lastne evidence in se pogovorite s kvalificiranim davčnim svetovalcem.",
  "What is KYC verification and why is it required?": "Kaj je preverjanje KYC in zakaj je potrebno?",
  "KYC (Know Your Customer) is a standard check of your identity. It helps keep accounts secure and is a routine part of opening an investment account.": "KYC (Know Your Customer) je standardno preverjanje vaše identitete. Pomaga ohranjati varnost računov in je rutinski del odpiranja investicijskega računa.",
  "Do I need prior investment experience?": "Ali potrebujem predhodne naložbene izkušnje?",
  "No. Every member has a personal financial analyst who guides you at every step, so you do not need prior knowledge of the markets.": "Ne. Vsak član ima osebnega finančnega analitika, ki vas vodi na vsakem koraku, zato ne potrebujete predznanja o trgih.",
  "Who manages my investments?": "Kdo upravlja moje naložbe?",
  "A dedicated financial analyst, backed by AI tools, working around your goals and risk level. The analyst combines professional expertise with technology — decisions remain human.": "Predan finančni analitik, podprt z orodji umetne inteligence, dela okoli vaših ciljev in stopnje tveganja. Analitik združuje strokovno znanje in izkušnje s tehnologijo – odločitve ostajajo človeške.",
  "Does the platform meet regulatory standards?": "Ali platforma izpolnjuje regulativne standarde?",
  "Yes — it meets national financial and cybersecurity standards, with account protection and verification built in.": "Da — izpolnjuje nacionalne finančne standarde in standarde kibernetske varnosti, z vgrajeno zaščito računa in preverjanjem.",
  "Can I add more funds to my account later?": "Ali lahko pozneje dodam več sredstev na svoj račun?",
  "Yes. You can top up your account at any time and adjust your plan with your analyst as your goals evolve.": "ja Svoj račun lahko kadar koli napolnite in svoj načrt prilagodite skupaj z analitikom, ko se vaši cilji razvijajo.",
