  "Each account is assigned a single specialist, not a rotating shift, so the person you speak to in the third month is the same person who set everything up in the first. They walk through the plan, explain what each step does, and answer questions in plain language.": "Vsakemu računu je dodeljen en specialist, ne menjajoča se izmena, tako da je oseba, s katero govorite v tretjem mesecu, ista oseba, ki je vse nastavila v prvem mesecu. Sprehodijo se skozi načrt, razložijo, kaj naredi vsak korak, in odgovorijo na vprašanja v preprostem jeziku.",
  "What they will not do": "Česa ne bodo storili",
  "They will not place anything without your instruction, and they will not push you to increase a balance. If a call ever feels like that, say so: that is not how the service is meant to work.": "Brez vaših navodil ne bodo postavili ničesar in vas ne bodo prisilili, da povečate ravnotežje. Če se vam kdaj zdi klic tako, povejte: storitev naj ne bi delovala tako.",
