  "The balance appears once the payment clears, and a specialist walks through the plan before anything is opened. Nothing is placed automatically on your behalf.": "Stanje se prikaže, ko je plačilo počiščeno, strokovnjak pa pregleda načrt, preden se kar koli odpre. Nič ni samodejno nameščeno v vašem imenu.",
