  "Withdrawals return to the payment method the money arrived from: that is a requirement, not a preference, so the account stays yours. Processing is free from our side; the only deduction you may see is the one your own bank or card issuer applies.": "Dvigi se vrnejo na način plačila, s katerega je denar prispel: to je zahteva, ne prednost, zato račun ostane vaš. Obdelava je z naše strani brezplačna; edini odbitek, ki ga lahko vidite, je tisti, ki ga uporabi vaša banka ali izdajatelj kartice.",
