  "The people behind your account": "Ljudje, ki stojijo za vašim računom",
  "Behind the interface are analysts who study the markets every day, engineers who keep the platform running, and support specialists who reply in your language.": "Za vmesnikom stojijo analitiki, ki vsak dan preučujejo trge, inženirji, ki skrbijo za delovanje platforme, in strokovnjaki za podporo, ki odgovarjajo v vašem jeziku.",
