  "The first version did one thing: show a balance and a position in plain terms. Everything else was stripped out until that part was clear.": "Prva različica je naredila eno stvar: prikazala ravnotežje in položaj v preprostih izrazih. Vse ostalo je bilo odstranjeno, dokler ta del ni bil jasen.",
