  "Automation answers what and when; people answer why. Support specialists were added so every member has someone to ask.": "Avtomatizacija odgovarja, kaj in kdaj; ljudje odgovorijo zakaj. Dodani so bili strokovnjaki za podporo, tako da lahko vsak član koga vpraša.",
